SUMMARY:Marc Maron: Yammering into the Void Tour LIVE at Rialto Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260718T100700Z
DTSTART:20260718T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nMarc M
	aron is a legendary stand-up comedian\, actor\, and podcaster whose raw\, 
	confessional style has earned him a devoted following over three decades i
	n comedy. Best known as the host of the massively influential WTF with Mar
	c Maron podcast\, Maron has also starred in the critically acclaimed IFC s
	eries Maron and appeared in numerous films and TV shows. \nHis stand-up is
	 deeply personal\, brutally honest\, and darkly funny — exploring themes o
	f anxiety\, addiction\, relationships\, and the absurdity of modern life. 
	Maron has released several acclaimed Netflix specials including Too Real\,
	 End Times Fun\, and From Bleak to Dark\, each showcasing his evolution as
	 a storyteller and comedian. \nThe Yammering into the Void Tour promises a
	ll-new material from one of comedy’s most authentic and compelling voices.
	 If you appreciate comedy that makes you think as much as it makes you lau
	gh\, this is the show for you. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 18
	\, 2026\nDoors: 6:00 PM | Show Time: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Rialto Theatre\, 318 
	Congress St\, Tucson\, AZ 85701\nTicket Price Range: $61 – $364\nAge Restr
	ictions: All ages welcome\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Rialto Theatre is one of
	 Tucson’s most beloved and historic entertainment venues\, located in the 
	vibrant downtown arts district on Congress Street. Originally built in 192
	0\, the Rialto has been beautifully restored and now serves as a premier m
	id-size venue with a capacity of approximately 1\,300 guests. \nThe venue 
	features a general admission floor area\, reserved balcony seating\, and e
	xcellent acoustics that make every performance feel intimate and immersive
	. The Rialto’s historic architecture — with its ornate details and warm li
	ghting — creates a truly special atmosphere for live comedy and music even
	ts. \nStreet parking and nearby parking garages are available in the downt
	own area. The venue is surrounded by great restaurants and bars\, making i
	t easy to turn the evening into a full night out in Tucson’s lively downto
	wn scene. \nWhat to Expect\nMarc Maron’s Yammering into the Void Tour is a
	 solo stand-up performance featuring brand-new material. Expect Maron’s si
	gnature stream-of-consciousness storytelling\, sharp cultural observations
	\, and deeply personal confessions delivered with his trademark intensity 
	and wit. \nThe show runs approximately 75–90 minutes. Maron’s performances
	 are known for their conversational intimacy — even in a packed venue\, it
	 feels like he’s talking directly to you. This is a rare opportunity to se
	e one of comedy’s most respected voices perform live in an intimate settin
	g. \nDoors open at 6:00 PM. Arrive early to grab a drink at the bar and so
	ak in the Rialto’s historic atmosphere before the show. \nTicket Informati
	on\nTickets range from $61 to $364 depending on seat location. Official ti
	ckets are available through Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are available thr
	ough VividSeats. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contain
	s affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through ou
	r links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject
	 to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycal
	endar.com/event/marc-maron-yammering-into-the-void-tour-live-at-rialto-the
	atre/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/marc-maron-yammering-into-the-void-tou
	r-live-at-rialto-theatre/
LOCATION:Rialto Theatre-Tucson\, 318 Congress St\, Tucson\, AZ\, 85701\, US
	A
