DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nAndrew Schulz LIVE at
	 Brea Improv\nOne of the most influential voices in modern comedy\, Andrew
	 Schulz brings his fearless\, unfiltered stand-up to the Brea Improv for t
	wo shows on July 18\, 2026. \nHis Netflix special LIFE spent 15 consecutiv
	e days in the U.S. Top 10 and appeared in the Top 10 across 13 countries. 
	This is a rare intimate club performance from a comedian who regularly sel
	ls out arenas. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2026\nTime: 7:0
	0 PM PDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\nAddress: 180 S Brea 
	Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nSeating: General Admission\,
	 first-come first-served\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required \nAbout
	 Andrew Schulz\nAndrew Schulz is a New York-native comedian whose Netflix 
	special LIFE became a global hit in 2025. He sold out Madison Square Garde
	n twice\, headlined the Kia Forum and Crypto.com Arena\, and his podcast F
	lagrant has crossed 1.4 billion total views on YouTube. He is known for hi
	s bold\, unfiltered comedy that covers politics\, pop culture\, and everyt
	hing in between. \nWhat to Expect\n\nFearless\, unfiltered stand-up from a
	 Netflix and arena headliner\nSharp commentary on culture\, politics\, and
	 everyday life\nA rare intimate club performance from a major comedy star\
	n21+ show with full bar and two-item minimum\nTwo shows available — early 
	and late\n\nVenue Information\nBrea Improv is located at 180 S Brea Blvd i
	n Brea\, CA. Part of the legendary Improv comedy club chain in Orange Coun
	ty\, CA. \nTicket Information\nOfficial tickets are sold out. Resale ticke
	ts available on VividSeats from $184. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \n
	Resale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn 
	a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to
	 you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID 
	may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-schu
	lz-live-at-brea-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-schulz-live-at-brea-improv/
LOCATION:Brea Improv\, 180 South Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA\, 92821\, United Sta
	tes
