	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nThe Second City “The Best of The Second City” LIVE
	 at Birchmere\nThe legendary Second City comedy troupe brings their acclai
	med “Best of The Second City” revue to the iconic Birchmere in Alexandria\
	, VA for one unforgettable night of sketch comedy\, improv\, and laughs. T
	his touring production showcases the very best material from one of the mo
	st celebrated comedy institutions in the world — the birthplace of legends
	 like Tina Fey\, Stephen Colbert\, and Bill Murray. \nEvent Details\nDate:
	 Saturday\, July 18\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: 
	Birchmere\nAddress: 3701 Mt. Vernon Ave\, Alexandria\, VA 22305\nAge Requi
	rement: All ages welcome (everyone requires a ticket)\nParking: Free on-si
	te parking available \nAbout The Second City\nThe Second City is the world
	’s premier comedy club\, theater\, and school of improvisation\, founded i
	n Chicago in 1959. With alumni including Tina Fey\, Stephen Colbert\, Bill
	 Murray\, John Belushi\, Gilda Radner\, and dozens more comedy legends\, T
	he Second City has shaped modern comedy for over six decades. Their tourin
	g productions bring the best of their revue-style sketch comedy to audienc
	es across North America. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA high-energy evening of sket
	ch comedy and improvisation from one of comedy’s most storied institutions
	\nHilarious scenes\, songs\, and characters drawn from The Second City’s l
	egendary catalog\nA talented ensemble cast of performers trained in the Se
	cond City tradition\nSharp\, witty commentary on modern life delivered wit
	h expert comedic timing\nAn intimate setting at the beloved Birchmere venu
	e in Alexandria\nA show suitable for comedy fans of all backgrounds and ag
	es\n\nVenue Information\nThe Birchmere is one of the most beloved music an
	d comedy venues in the Washington\, DC area\, located at 3701 Mt. Vernon A
	ve in Alexandria\, VA. Known for its intimate atmosphere and excellent sig
	htlines\, the Birchmere offers free on-site parking and a full-service bar
	 and restaurant. The venue is fully handicap accessible. \nTicket Informat
	ion\nTickets start at $55 (face value) or $70.20 through Ticketmaster. Res
	ale tickets are also available through VividSeats. There is an 8-ticket li
	mit per order. Will Call opens at 5 PM the night of the show. \nOfficial T
