DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nRodney Ca
	rrington is one of America’s most beloved comedians — a blue-collar entert
	ainer who combines stand-up comedy with country music in a way that is uni
	quely\, hilariously his own. Born and raised in Texas\, Carrington has bee
	n making audiences laugh and sing along for over three decades. \nHis brea
	kthrough came with the 1998 album Hangin’ With Rodney\, and he has since r
	eleased eight comedy albums\, starred in his own ABC sitcom Rodney\, co-wr
	itten and co-starred with Toby Keith in the feature film Beer For My Horse
	s\, and released a Netflix special Here Comes the Truth. He is consistentl
	y ranked among America’s Top 10 highest-grossing comedians. \nFans can exp
	ect a raucous\, laugh-out-loud night of stand-up comedy and musical comedy
	\, featuring Rodney’s signature songs and stories about life\, love\, and 
	everything in between. His shows are known for being wildly funny and genu
	inely heartfelt — a rare combination that keeps fans coming back year afte
	r year. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM \
	nVenue: MGM Northfield Park – Center Stage\, 10777 Northfield Road\, North
	field\, OH 44067 \nAge Restriction: \nAbout the Venue\nMGM Northfield Park
	 – Center Stage is Northeast Ohio’s premier casino entertainment venue\, l
	ocated just 20 miles south of Cleveland inside the MGM Northfield Park com
	plex off I-271 in Northfield\, Ohio. \nCenter Stage offers a world-class e
	ntertainment experience with excellent sightlines\, a full-service bar\, a
	nd the lively atmosphere of a casino showroom. The venue’s intimate layout
	 ensures every seat delivers a great view of the stage\, making it one of 
	the best places in the region to catch a live comedy show. \nAmple on-site
	 parking\, easy highway access\, a full casino floor\, and multiple dining
	 options throughout the complex make MGM Northfield Park the ideal destina
	tion for a complete evening of entertainment in Northeast Ohio. \nWhat to 
	Expect\nRodney Carrington delivers a full evening of stand-up comedy and m
	usical comedy that blends laugh-out-loud jokes with his signature country 
	songs. His shows are high-energy\, crowd-pleasing\, and packed with the ki
	nd of humor that makes you feel right at home. \nExpect an opener to kick 
	off the night before Rodney takes the stage for a headlining set that cove
	rs everything from relationships and family to the absurdities of everyday
	 life — all with his trademark Texas charm and comedic timing. \nNote: Thi
	s is a 21+ event. Content is for mature audiences. Please bring valid gove
	rnment-issued ID. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $85 (prices may
	 vary based on demand) \nSecure your seats through official Ticketmaster c
	hannels or find resale tickets via VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Ti
	ckets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no
	 extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/rodney-carrington-
	live-at-mgm-northfield-park-center-stage/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
