SUMMARY:Aries Spears LIVE at Funny Bone Comedy Club - Omaha (Sunday)
DTSTAMP:20260718T100700Z
DTSTART:20260719T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nAries Spears LIVE at Funny Bone – Omaha\nDon’t mis
	s the final show of Aries Spears’ Omaha engagement as this stand-up comedy
	 powerhouse closes out his weekend run at Funny Bone Comedy Club. Known fo
	r his razor-sharp wit and explosive energy\, Aries Spears delivers a comed
	y experience you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, July 19\, 2
	026\nTime: 6:00 PM (Doors open at 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Funny Bone Comedy Club\
	, 710 N 114th St\, Suite 210\, Omaha\, NE 68154\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Val
	id photo ID required)\nTicket Price: $37 – $42 \nAbout Aries Spears\nAries
	 Spears is a veteran stand-up comedian and actor best known for his long r
	un on MADtv\, where his uncanny celebrity impressions made him a household
	 name. With decades of experience on stage and screen\, Spears brings a hi
	gh-energy\, no-holds-barred style to every performance. He has appeared on
	 numerous TV specials and continues to tour nationally to sold-out crowds.
	 \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a MADtv legend\nHila
	rious celebrity impressions and sharp observational humor\nAn intimate com
	edy club atmosphere\nFull bar and dinner menu available\nThe final show of
	 the weekend – don’t miss your last chance!\n\nTicket Information\nTickets
	 for the Sunday 6:00 PM show start at $37. Seating is general admission. \
	nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We
	 earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra c
	ost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid phot
	o ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/aries-
	spears-live-at-funny-bone-comedy-club-omaha-sunday/\n\nFrom Comedy Calenda
	r
